  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3867233f-a41d-499c-8cca-ae05ac6c4d0e.png\"></p>\n<p>《Easy Disenchanting》是一款兼容原版的模組，僅需使用鐵砧即可從裝備中提取附魔，無需新增任何方塊或物品！&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_557b70ef-27bd-4675-8841-79bcefd50325.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/EasyDisenchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_891ba103-aea9-4258-8301-afcc9a6981b6.png\"></p>\n<p>本模組為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-transfer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Transfer</a> 的重製版本，已更新支援新版 Minecraft，並修復了關鍵錯誤與進行了多項改進，包含支援將附魔轉移並合併至已有附魔的書上。</p>\n<p>操作非常簡單：只需在鐵砧中將劍與空白書合併，即可從該物品中提取附魔：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_56a541ac-81fa-4866-98ec-7f830c4407d1.png\"></p>\n<p>若您想將附魔提取至已有附魔的書上，請將該書置於第一個槽位。這將以合併兩本附魔書相同的方式，進行附魔的合併與疊加。</p>\n<p>預設情況下，《Easy Disenchanting》的經驗消耗量與原版合併附魔相同，且會將去除附魔後的物品歸還給您。您可以在設定檔中調整這兩項參數以進行遊戲平衡。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
